  "_readme": [
    "INVENTED MESSAGES. Not admissible as GO evidence, and the harness says so on every run.",
    "These can fail the pipeline but cannot pass it: they measure the phrasings whoever wrote",
    "them thought of, not how the people in that group actually write.",
    "Use: a regression floor, and a NO-GO detector. Replace with real wording from the message",
    "log as it accumulates - a case may carry messageId instead of text.",
    "Location and city are deliberately not asserted: they depend on DETECTION_KNOWN_LOCATIONS",
    "and DETECTION_KNOWN_CITIES, so scoring them would measure the deployment, not the parser."
  ],
